etween lovers and fakes,\nSo baby, I talk talk, I talk to you,\nIn the night in your dream, of love so true.\nI talk talk, I talk to you,\nIn the night in your dream, of love so true.\nIn the night, in my dreams,\nI'm in love with you, 'Cause you talk to me like lovers do,\nI feel joy I feel pain, 'Cause it's still the same,\nWhen the night is gone I'll be alone.\"", "channel_id": "UC6N_QH3lDeGY3xvtnF7pLMA", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC6N_QH3lDeGY3xvtnF7pLMA", "duration": 239, "view_count": 219790478, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pav2f4b-1ZE", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["Real McCoy", "Real McCoy Official", "RealMccoyvevo", "come and get your love", "remix 2014", "love and devotion", "another night", "video", "Real McCoy Live", "acoustic", "music", "european edition", "Real Mccoy Another Night Lyrics", "hip hop", "instrumental", "rap", "vevo", "european version", "Real McCoy Another Night", "official", "extended", "run away", "download", "Real McCoy Another Night Live", "one more time", "Real McCoy another night remix", "karaoke", "remix", "Real McCoy Lyrics", "lyrics", "operator", "call for love", "audio"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en": [{"url": "https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timedtext_playlist/expire/1788339166/ei/fY-Xas3QMJykobIPgIeA6A0/ip/18.229.136.40/id/3dabf67f86fed591/source/youtube/requiressl/yes/dur/238.366/tts_params/caps%3Dasr%26v%3DPav2f4b-1ZE%26lang%3Den%26name%3Den%26ip%3D18.229.136.40%26ipbits%3D0%26expire%3D1788339166%26sparams%3Dip,ipbits,expire,caps,v%26signature%3D34492FDC5596B5A7E684A1B6A0D04A57E66EA5D6.333DF3E23063C54926A2B91E03AC670CCA5D1461%26key%3Ddg_yt0/rqh/4/hls_chunk_host/rr1---sn-bg0s7nls.googlevideo.com/xpc/EgVo2aDSNQ%3D%3D/cps/918/met/1788317565,/mh/Aq/mm/18,26/m